      "id": "greeting",
      "speaker": "tiewushuang",
      "text": "哟，兄弟来了！来，先喝口酒暖暖身子。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_forge",
          "text": "请教武艺心得",
          "next_node": "forge_teaching",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": "tiewushuang",
              "value": 10,
              "operator": ">="
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_chat",
          "text": "随便聊聊",
          "next_node": "casual_chat"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_leave",
          "text": "告辞",
          "next_node": "farewell"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "forge_teaching",
      "speaker": "tiewushuang",
      "text": "习武之道，招式是表，气血是里。我这套降龙掌讲究先发制人、掌掌到肉。你若想学，我可以教你几手扎实的基本功。",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "next_node": "farewell"
    },
    {
      "id": "casual_chat",
      "speaker": "tiewushuang",
      "text": "这些年走南闯北，听过不少名剑传说。最让我念念不忘的，还是那把青冥剑——据说剑成之日寒光冲斗，后来剑随人走，不知流落何方。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "next_node": "farewell"
    },
    {
      "id": "farewell",
      "speaker": "tiewushuang",
      "text": "有空再来，丐帮分舵随时欢迎你，酒管够！",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "is_end": true
    }
  ]
}
